<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Refining doubles first half profit.</title>
<headline>NZ Refining doubles first half profit.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 27.61 vs 13.84</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				  230 vs 115</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				 75.0 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover				   138.3 vs 124.2</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			     41.5 vs 20.6</p>
<p>    Tax					   13.9 vs 6.8</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)	  24.0 vs 24.0</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 21</p>
<p>Reg date Oct 11</p>
<p>    Ex div   Oct 14</p>
<p>Note - New Zealand Refining is an oil refiner.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
